{"id":"335657d6abd50434","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-cograph.md","title":"Cographs by disjoint union and join","display":"df-cograph — Cographs by disjoint union and join","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-cograph","aliases":["27-df-cograph"],"display":"df-cograph — Cographs by disjoint union and join","depends_on":["[[27-df-graph]]","[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.4 recursive cograph construction","source_printed_pages":"463–464","source_pdf_pages":"487–488","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-explicit-finite-construction","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-cograph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-cograph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cograph — Cographs by disjoint union and join"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.4 recursive cograph construction"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"463–464"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"487–488"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-explicit-finite-construction"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 为顶点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 非空有限、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\binom V2\">\\(E\\subseteq\\binom V2\\)</span> 的简单图。对两顶点集不交图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i=(V_i,E_i)\">\\(G_i=(V_i,E_i)\\)</span>，下式定义并与连接；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vert}\">\\(\\mathrm{Vert}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a>。本节引入图谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cograph}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cograph}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_1\\sqcup G_2\\coloneqq(V_1\\cup V_2,E_1\\cup E_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_1\\sqcup G_2\\coloneqq(V_1\\cup V_2,E_1\\cup E_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_1*G_2\\coloneqq(V_1\\cup V_2,E_1\\cup E_2\\cup\\{\\{u,v\\}\\mid u\\in V_1,\\ v\\in V_2\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_1*G_2\\coloneqq(V_1\\cup V_2,E_1\\cup E_2\\cup\\{\\{u,v\\}\\mid u\\in V_1,\\ v\\in V_2\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\{v\\},\\emptyset)\\mid v\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\{v\\},\\emptyset)\\mid v\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{r+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal C_r\\cup\n\\{G_1\\sqcup G_2,G_1*G_2\\mid G_1,G_2\\in\\mathcal C_r,\\ \\mathrm{Vert}(G_1)\\cap\\mathrm{Vert}(G_2)=\\emptyset\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_{r+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal C_r\\cup\n\\{G_1\\sqcup G_2,G_1*G_2\\mid G_1,G_2\\in\\mathcal C_r,\\ \\mathrm{Vert}(G_1)\\cap\\mathrm{Vert}(G_2)=\\emptyset\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow G\\in\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal C_r.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow G\\in\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal C_r.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10.4，印刷 pp.463–464／PDF pp.487–488。二元操作迭代等价于书中任意有限个不交图的并/连接。层递归只依赖前层，唯一确定有限构造类；特意把空图排除，与cotree至少一叶的接口一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"reso