df-cograph|df-cograph — Cographs by disjoint union and join]]"},{"id":"649052f5ff4caaa5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,E)$ 是 [[27-df-cograph]] 的非空有限简单图，$V\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。诱导子图、补图及图投影 $\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Conn}$ 是下式定义的图谓词，二元谓词 $\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]。$\\mathrm{Cograph}$ 取上述定义。"}],"outgoing":["448689b85eeddd41","d87d01e5686c19fe"]}